GetValue [SimTalk] - COM
Returns the value of the specified attribute of the designated Plant Simulation object.
Type
Function
Syntax
PlantSim.GetValue(ObjectName:string) -> any
Parameter
The parameter ObjectName of data type string designates the name of the Plant Simulation object and the
name of the attribute.
Return Value
The return value has the data type any.
Example
// JScript
var PlantSim = 
WScript.CreateObject("Tecnomatix.PlantSimulation.RemoteControl")
