LoadModel [SimTalk] - COM
Loads the specified Plant Simulation simulation model.
Remarks
LoadModel corresponds to the command Open Model on the Quick Access Toolbar.
The function LoadModel does not load call chains.
Type
Function
Syntax
PlantSim.LoadModel(ModelName:string[, Password:string])
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters.
• The parameter ModelName of data type string designates the name of the model that you want to
open.
• The optional parameter Password of data type string designates the password that is used for loading an
encrypted model.
Example
// JScript
var PlantSim = 
WScript.CreateObject("Tecnomatix.PlantSimulation.RemoteControl")
PlantSim.LoadModel("C:\\Modely\MyCOMTest.spp")
See also
Open Model File
