SetTrustModels [SimTalk]
Sets if the COM Interface permits models to have access to the computer or not.
Type
Function
Syntax
PlantSim.SetTrustModels(Trust:boolean)
Parameter
The parameter Trust of data type boolean sets if the COM Interface permits models to have access to the
computer (true) or not (false).
Specifying true corresponds to the start option /TrustModels, meaning that general access to the
computer is permitted and that model-specific or library-specific settings are overridden.
Example
// JScipt
var PlantSim = 
WScript.CreateObject("Tecnomatix.PlantSimulation.RemoteControl")
PlantSim.SetVisible(true)
PlantSim.SetTrustModels(true)
See also
Specifying Start Options
Prohibit Access to the Computer [model settings]
