FireSimTalkMessage [SimTalk]
Triggers the event SimTalkMessage from within SimTalk.
Remarks
The name of the function, which will be triggered, depends on the programming language you use, such
as Visual Basic, JavaScript, etc. Check the documentation that came with your programming application for
details.
Note
You have to specify a parameter of data type string.
Example
fireSimTalkMessage("The buffer is full.")
